# Final Principle

Sambo is not simply a combination of Judo and Wrestling.

It is a combat sport built upon explosive transitions,

continuous initiative,

efficient leverage,

dynamic control,

and rapid adaptation.

The athlete who dominates the transition between positions creates the greatest probability of victory.